# NOTE: package.json / package-lock.json used to be listed here, back when the
# site was purely static. They must ship now: Vercel reads them to install the
# database driver the /api/ functions import. vercel.json's installCommand adds
# --omit=dev so sharp (a build-time-only tool) is not installed on every deploy.
